committer MinGyu2 <mq04034@naver.com> 1794749402 +0900

geul Stage 5-A: system font source hook for platform font configuration

FontDb can now catalog installed fonts from an embedder-supplied
SystemFontSource (fontconfig, a native font API, ...) instead of walking
the fixed platform font folders. The source also answers configured
aliases/generic families (used by FontDb::face and word::resolve only
after Word's own substitutes) and preferred fallback families for
uncovered characters (tried before the built-in fallback list; coverage
is still checked). A source that lists no files leaves only bundled and
user fonts, without walking folders in its place.

Rescans (load_system_fonts / set_system_font_source) now drop alias,
miss and fallback caches and bump FontDb::generation, so layout caches
keyed on it notice catalog changes. Without a source the behaviour is
unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
